{"pageid":3842,"title":"Box Of Chocolates","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Box Of Chocolates</span>","revid":21079,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote><p><i>\"Life is like a box of chocolates, you never know what you're going to get\"</i></p></blockquote>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Box_Of_Chocolates\">Box Of Chocolates</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Box of Chocolates</b> is an event item that can be purchased at <a href=\"/wiki/Hearty_Exchange\" title=\"Hearty Exchange\">Hearty Exchange</a> for $349. It is one of 2 items that have a RNG component in the valentines update.\n</p><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"optionalTitle\">Box Of Chocolates</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f2/Box_of_Chocolates_Clean.png/revision/latest?cb=20250218093055\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Box of Chocolates Clean\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f2/Box_of_Chocolates_Clean.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250218093055\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f2/Box_of_Chocolates_Clean.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20250218093055 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/f/f2/Box_of_Chocolates_Clean.png/revision/latest?cb=20250218093055 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Box of Chocolates Clean\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Box_of_Chocolates_Clean.png\" data-image-name=\"Box of Chocolates Clean.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t