 pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">February 14th, 2025</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Possible_Items\">Possible Items</span></h2>\n<p>When the player opens the box of chocolates, one of 17 items will spawn:\n</p>\n<h3><span id=\"Dark.2FMilk_Chocolate\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dark/Milk_Chocolate\"><big>Dark/Milk Chocolate</big></span></h3>\n<p>Dark/Milk chocolate figurines have around a 76/77 (98.5%) chance of spawning, making them the majority of chocolates obtained by players. Dark/Milk chocolate figurines can come in the following shapes: <b>cow</b>, <b>rat</b>, <b>grabber</b>, <b>mannequin</b>, <b>cheese</b>, <b>moai</b>, <b>duckie</b>, and <b>gurt</b>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Figurine\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Chance of Obtaining\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Chocolate_Cow\" title=\"Chocolate Cow\">Chocolate Cow</a>\n</td>\n<td>N/A<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-center show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 181px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0a/Chocolate_Cow.png/revision/latest?cb=20250301180724\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Chocolate Cow\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/0/0a/Chocolate_Cow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/181?cb=20250301180724\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"181\" height=\"166\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Chocolate Cow.png\" data-image-key=\"Chocolate_Cow.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a> \t \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Chocolate_Cow.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n</td>\n<td>12.3%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/C