n class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"White_Chocolate\"><big>White Chocolate</big></span></h3>\n<p>White chocolate figurines have a 1/77 (1.3%) chance of spawning, making them much rarer than their dark/milk chocolate counterparts. White chocolate figurines can come in the same shapes as dark/milk chocolate: <b>cow</b>, <b>rat</b>, <b>grabber</b>, <b>mannequin</b>, <b>cheese</b>, <b>moai</b>, <b>duckie</b>, and <b>gurt</b>.\n</p>\n<table class=\"mw-collapsible fandom-table\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Figurine\n</th>\n<th>Picture\n</th>\n<th>Chance of Obtaining\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/White_Chocolate_Cow\" title=\"White Chocolate Cow\">White Chocolate Cow</a>\n</td>\n<td><figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/41/Whitechocolatecow.png/revision/latest?cb=20250308124111\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Whitechocolatecow\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"151\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Whitechocolatecow.png\" data-image-key=\"Whitechocolatecow.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/41/Whitechocolatecow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250308124111\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/41/Whitechocolatecow.png/revision/latest?cb=20250308124111\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Whitechocolatecow\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/41/Whitechocolatecow.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250308124111\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"151\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Whitechocolatecow.png\" data-image-key=\"Whitechocolatecow.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/image